<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.3 /10.2	10.7 /10.5     11.2 /11.0</p>
<p>BPI			10.35/10.25     10.65/10.55    11.125/11</p>
<p>Hong Kong Bank	 10.45/10.35     10.75 /10.6    11.35 /11.10</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.4/10.3	 10.7/10.55     11.2/11.05</p>
<p>Metrobank		10.4/10.3	 10.7/10.55     11.15/11.0</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.4 /10.2	10.75/10.6     11.25 /11.05</p>
<p>PNB			10.3/10.2	 10.6/10.5	11.05/10.95</p>
<p>Multinational	  10.375/10.125   10.65/10.5     11.1/10.95</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
